[[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"dismantling\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Dismantling</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"reassembling\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Reassembling</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (right)</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the tappet cover (1b).</p><p>Act on the drive pulley bolt using a suitable\nspanner so that the valves are in the closed position.</p><p>2. With the engine cold, check, using a feeler gauge, that with\nthe valves in a closed position the clearance is within the recommended\nvalues.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Clearance (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.25 - 0.35</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Clearance (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.30 - 0.40</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014991.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"reassembling\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Reassembling</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"dismantling\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Dismantling</a><p>1. Fit the tappet cover (1a) and fix it tightening the bolts (1b)\nto the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAM COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8 ÷ 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014992.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (left).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]